> > > > > > > > > ## DIRICHLET IMPLEMENTATION OF BARS ---------
> > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > ## This model has to separately cater for cases where
> > > > > > > > > ## there is a single knot provided as a scalar otherwise
> > > > > > > > > ## model does not compile
